  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/banner-text.webp\" alt=\"標誌\"></p><h2><strong>Minecraft: Java Edition 的模組/資料包</strong></h2><h1>你看不見他，但我保證他看得見你…</h1><p>進入《From The Fog》所帶來的恐懼與神秘世界，這是一個讓傳說中的 Herobrine 以忠於傳說、令人毛骨悚然且身歷其境的方式重現於 Minecraft 的模組。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunareclipse.studio%252fdownload%252fFrom-The-Fog%252fwallpaper%252f3rd-Birthday\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/wallpaper-promo.webp\" style=\"margin-left:auto !important;margin-right:auto !important\">\n</a></p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flilypad.gg%252flunareclipse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/partners/lilypad_transparent.webp?v=6\" style=\"margin-left:auto !important;margin-right:auto !important\">\n</a></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/banner.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/forest-encounter.webp\" alt=\"森林遭遇\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/window-watcher.webp\" alt=\"窗邊守望者\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/new-grove.webp\" alt=\"新樹叢\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/shrine-suprise.webp\" alt=\"神殿驚喜\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/unknown-entity-err.webp\" alt=\"未知實體錯誤\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/more-skins!.webp\" alt=\"更多造型！\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/ocean-sand-pyramid.webp\" alt=\"海洋沙金字塔\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.lunareclipse.studio/img/projects/from-the-fog/gallery/2x2-tunnel.webp\" alt=\"2x2 隧道\"></p><h2><strong>安裝</strong></h2><h4>穩定版本</h4><p><a href=\"https://github.com/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog\" alt=\"GitHub 發布\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunareclipse.studio%252fko-fi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/donate to-kofi-7e18c7?logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a></p><p>《From The Fog》的最新版本發布於我們的 <a href=\"https://github.com/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 發布頁面</a>。\n這些版本被認為<strong>適合一般使用</strong>，但無法保證完全無錯誤或其他問題。</p><hr><h2><strong>社群</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RmMtqxJJgH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/chat on-discord-7289DA?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord 聊天\"></a></p><p>我們有一個 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lunareclipse.studio%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 Discord 社群。</a>加入後，您可以：</p><ul>\n<li>獲得安裝幫助和技術支援</li>\n<li>即時接收最新開發進度的通知</li>\n<li>與社群其他成員交流互動。</li>\n</ul><hr><h2><strong>授權條款</strong></h2><p>此專案採用 Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International（CC BY-NC-SA 4.0）授權。您可以自由使用和修改此模組/資料包，只要標示原作者姓名、非商業用途，並以相同授權方式分享任何修改。詳情請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/LunarEclipseStudios/From-The-Fog/blob/main/LICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a> 檔案。</p><hr><h2><strong>網站</strong></h2><p>歡迎造訪我們的網站！\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunareclipse.studio%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://lunareclipse.studio</a></p>",
